# Week 8 — HC-POD Final Integration Record

## Status
The Data Science cross-track dependency opened in Week 6, and re-tested against in Week 7, remains **unresolved**. No response was received from the Data Science track intern at any point across Weeks 6, 7, or 8.

## Timeline
| Week | Action | Outcome |
|---|---|---|
| 6 | Outreach sent to Data Science intern requesting: (1) confirmation of features used in their baseline model, (2) model performance on the defined high-risk segment, (3) feature-importance ranking. | No response by Week 6 deadline. |
| 6 | In the absence of a response, a self-built baseline model was constructed using Data Analytics' own recommended features, to avoid submitting untested recommendations. | Logistic Regression vs. Random Forest compared on a single train/test split. |
